{"reviews":[{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-0","r":5.0,"t":"Get It and You Wont Regret It","x":"Just Sexy . Sexy Floral Sweet Toss up. Each \u2797 so Perfectly that it's Blows most of its kind out that water. This perfume is Outdone itself and honestlt is sexier than most any reg. Victoria Secret perfume. Yet , it reminds me of Victoria Secret Pure Seduction or some perfume similar to it...its a light caramel gourmand Floral and delicious. This is a Must Have. You would want to wear this Scent if you want a Man to be Like WANTING TO EAT YOU literally its amazingly sweet and floral and keeps you","h":54,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-1","r":1.0,"t":"Her hips lied this time :(","x":"It\u2019s beautiful like Shakira, but I don\u2019t think she got a chance to smell this before it hit the product line. Yuck. It\u2019s one of those bad smells that you keep smelling and thinking- this stinks- why do I keep smelling it? Disappointingly yucky. Either the fragrance description was written by a drunken monkey or the product I received was fraudulent:( I\u2019m done with the review, but feel compelled to keep writing. There are no floral tones, notes, treble clefs whatever. More like a post-poop diaper","h":51,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-2","r":5.0,"t":"Smells great!","x":"This was a blind buy based on the notes. I wanted a new night scent. Something sweet and feminine. This is it. I am very happy with my order. The bottle is pretty but the actual scent is a very nice floral gourmand. I can smell the jasmine mixed with vanilla and cocoa. Beautiful.","h":37,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-3","r":5.0,"t":"Her best smelling perfume yet!","x":"Her best smelling perfume yet! It smells very mature and makes me now feel my age. Perfect for a date night, night, or edgy day wear. I personally, love to wear it everyday! The bottle is super cute and has a nice dark sparkle design to add to my bathroom decor.","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-4","r":3.0,"t":"Water down","x":"This perfume is very water down, this is the second one I got because the first one came in very good and smelled good even the color is different the first one it looked pinkish and this one is just clear. Not buying it again from this seller.","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-5","r":1.0,"t":"The sent is very waterd down","x":"Got this for my wife and the initial spray is very fruity and pleasing but after 5 minutes the sent disappears...Shakira dents are Garbage as hell, I'll stick to Jessica Simpson Fancy line, or Jlo,","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-6","r":5.0,"t":"Best Shakira Fragrance so far!","x":"I have purchased most Shakira\u2019s perfumes and I have to say that this one is the most sensual and also stays on longer. Absolutely loved it!","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-7","r":5.0,"t":"Presentation and affordability","x":"We love Shakira, as an artist and as a decent human being. The presentation is beautiful, the scent is fabulous, and the cost is very affordable. My wife and daughter both loved their gift (each got one).","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-8","r":5.0,"t":"Smells amazing...very mellow...great price!","x":"This smells so good! And the size bottle is good for the price. It's very mellow in smell, so if your looking for a stronger scent this is not the one.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-9","r":5.0,"t":"Amazingly Sweet","x":"It\u2019s actually a great perfume for the price. Smells sweet, and long lasting on skin & clothes. Will purchase again &lt;3 Not granny smelling.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-10","r":5.0,"t":"Shakira Queen of Latin Music","x":"Shakira is my favorite singer of all time. This perfume did not disappoint.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-11","r":4.0,"t":"amazing!!","x":"first time trying a Shakira perfume and i\u2019m not disappointed. i bought this after reading the notes. i\u2019m a big fan of gourmand fragrances and had to buy. the dry down of this perfume smells similar to carolina herrera good girl in my opinion, which i love!!","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-12","r":5.0,"t":"Smells Great!","x":"I bought this for my sister for her birthday and she LOVES IT! Will I purchase this again? Maybe, the scent is amazing but I have smelled perfumes similar in smell plus this is quite expensive, it\u2019s the size of my palm to my fingers so it\u2019s not too big but There are replacements when it comes to smell, But my sister loves it!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-13","r":5.0,"t":"Very similar to YSL libre","x":"I am very pleasantly surprised with this blind buy. Never smelled it but bought it based on the good reviews. It smells very similar to YSL Libre. Very warm, yet fresh. It lasts about 3 to 4 hours, and for the price point, I think its ok to reapply it once a day. I have 100+ perfumes and can say this one is wonderful!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-14","r":5.0,"t":"Reminds me of something","x":"I purchased this blindly while looking for some new fragrances to try. I really love the bottle, not crazy about the tiny cap. I sprayed it on immediately after receiving it a few hours ago, and I can still smell it. Its definitely strong but not overbearing. It really reminds me of something I had in the early 2000's, but I can't quite remember which perfume it reminds me of. I'm excited ton wear this out on a night out. :)","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-15","r":5.0,"t":"Smells very good","x":"This is my first time trying Shakira\u2019s perfumes, I bought This one and it smells very very good. I love it so much.The smell, the presentation everything is a 10/10. Good jod SHAKI! Prolly gon buy more from Shakira. Can\u2019t wait to try her other\u2019s perfumes","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-16","r":3.0,"t":"Not so good","x":"When I got the package the bottle looked like it had been used. The \"metal\" around the sprayer was peeling. The smell was not as described either. The only thing that was good about it was the shape of the bottle. I'm not enthused about this purchase.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-17","r":1.0,"t":"I think is fake, last me only an hour ...","x":"I think is fake , last me only an hour when I put it on :(","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-18","r":5.0,"t":"Whoa, this is gorgeous!","x":"This perfume is gorgeous and for the price, I'll grab another one. The opening is lavender/citrusy/green. The dry down reminds me a lot of YSL Libre EDT.  Really well made. It lasts pretty good too. On me at least 6h. This new release is wow! I am impressed Shakira \u2764","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-19","r":5.0,"t":"Smells amazing!","x":"Love the scent!  Spicy vs floral and the bottle looks like art!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-20","r":5.0,"t":"Long lasting fragrance","x":"My friend recommended this perfume. I love the bottle and the scent lasts all day.  It is a sweet smell, but not floral.  It has a clean smell and very Feminine. The price is good and I will buy again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-21","r":4.0,"t":"Nice fragrance!","x":"My husband bought this for me without knowing if I\u2019d like it.  Very nice fragrance. Not too flowery. I\u2019d get it again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"I loved the smell and it was worth the price.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not the best!","x":"I thought by all the positive reviews this scent was going to be great. Guess I should\u2019ve passed on this one. It doesn\u2019t smell the best and apparently no one else I\u2019m in contact with cares for it. I usually have complimentary comments on previous scents. Definitely would not recommend this nor would I buy it again.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0BTJ6SYKB-24","r":5.0,"t":"The bottle alone is worth it !","x":"Perfume is very pleasing, the bottle is even nicer, shipping is a bit off, still says its on its way but arrived, great product and a great gift !","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the scent as sweet, floral, and gourmand, with many describing it as sexy and feminine.","cites":[1,3,4,10,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers find it good value for the price and long-lasting.","cites":[8,9,10,14]},{"text":"A notable number of reviewers complain the fragrance is watered down or fades quickly.","cites":[5,6,9]},{"text":"Some reviewers note it resembles other well-known perfumes such as Victoria's Secret, YSL Libre, or Good Girl.","cites":[1,12,14]},{"text":"Reviewers often mention the attractive bottle and presentation.","cites":[4,8,15]}]},"qa":[]}